  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "During testing migration tool 4.4.1 with Akruba source type fedora 3 objects when the --index-dir is turned on the utils too give error:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "no segments* file found in MMapDirectory@/.stagedata/migration_test lockFactory=                                                                                                                     org.apache.lucene.store.NativeFSLockFactory@1c5920df: files: []",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "org.apache.lucene.index.IndexNotFoundException: no segments* file found in MMapD                                                                                                                     irectory@/.stagedata/migration_test lockFactory=org.apache.lucene.store.NativeFS                                                                                                                     LockFactory@1c5920df: files: []",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "this issue seems to be happening only for akruba source-types, since legacy file types seems to be no issue in creating the index file.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
