  "description": "<p>During testing migration tool 4.4.1 with Akruba source type fedora 3 objects when the --index-dir is turned on the utils too give error:<br/>\nno segments* file found in MMapDirectory@/.stagedata/migration_test lockFactory=                                                                                                                     org.apache.lucene.store.NativeFSLockFactory@1c5920df: files: []<br/>\norg.apache.lucene.index.IndexNotFoundException: no segments* file found in MMapD                                                                                                                     irectory@/.stagedata/migration_test lockFactory=org.apache.lucene.store.NativeFS                                                                                                                     LockFactory@1c5920df: files: []</p>\n\n<p>this issue seems to be happening only for akruba source-types, since legacy file types seems to be no issue in creating the index file.</p>",
